    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU)'s Department of Anaesthesiology in collaboration with the Department of Continuing Professional Education (at AKU), Committee for European Education in Anaesthesiology (CEEA, which is affiliated with European Society of Anaesthesiologists), and World Federation of Societies of Anaesthesiologists (WFSA), successfully organized the CEEA Continuing Medical Education course titled 'Heart and Circulation' from March 20-22, 2015.",
